-- Tests for Annex 1, Annexes 2-4 (beyond the generated table tests), Parts II, III (Articles
-- 17-22), IV and V. Every expected value was worked by hand from the source text before it was
-- written here; the source lines are cited on each group. Both sides of every threshold and
-- date edge the document states are tested.

§ `Tests — definitions, the policyowner's rights, premiums, claims and general terms`

§§ `Fixtures`

`a man born on 10 June 1980` MEANS `Insured person` WITH
    `date of birth`                                       IS YMD 1980 6 10
    `sex`                                                 IS `male`
    `living in Vietnam when the application was submitted` IS TRUE
    `one in whom the policyowner has an insurable interest` IS TRUE
    `accepted for insurance by the Company`               IS TRUE

`an individual policyowner aged 42` MEANS Policyowner WITH
    `kind`                                            IS `an individual`
    `age in completed years`                          IS 42
    `full civil legal capacity`                       IS TRUE
    `lawfully established and operating in Vietnam`   IS FALSE
    `alive`                                           IS TRUE

GIVEN `the insured` IS AN `Insured person`
GIVETH A Policy
`a policy effective on 15 March 2022 for` `the insured` MEANS Policy WITH
    `effective date`                           IS YMD 2022 3 15
    `date the Company accepted the insurance`  IS YMD 2022 3 20
    `date of the latest reinstatement`         IS NOTHING
    `premium frequency`                        IS `yearly`
    `the insured`                              IS `the insured`
    `the policyowner`                          IS `an individual policyowner aged 42`

`the 1980 policy` MEANS `a policy effective on 15 March 2022 for` `a man born on 10 June 1980`

GIVEN `the date of birth` IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `Insured person`
`an insured born on` `the date of birth` MEANS `Insured person` WITH
    `date of birth`                                       IS `the date of birth`
    `sex`                                                 IS `female`
    `living in Vietnam when the application was submitted` IS TRUE
    `one in whom the policyowner has an insurable interest` IS TRUE
    `accepted for insurance by the Company`               IS TRUE

`the account of 1 billion` MEANS `Account snapshot` WITH
    `sum insured`                IS 1000 TIMES 1000000
    `basic account value`        IS 200 TIMES 1000000
    `top-up account value`       IS 50 TIMES 1000000
    `debts`                      IS 10 TIMES 1000000
    `annualised basic premium`   IS 20 TIMES 1000000

§§ `Annex 1 — ages and anniversaries (src 1305-1309, 1388-1392, 1408-1409)`

#ASSERT `the age in completed years, of a person born on` (YMD 1980 6 10) `, on` (YMD 2022 3 15) EQUALS 41
#ASSERT `the age in completed years, of a person born on` (YMD 1980 6 10) `, on` (YMD 2022 6 10) EQUALS 42
#ASSERT `the age in completed years, of a person born on` (YMD 1980 6 10) `, on` (YMD 2022 6 9) EQUALS 41
-- A 29 February birthday is reached on 28 February in a common year (fork F2).
#ASSERT `the day a person born on` (YMD 2004 2 29) `reaches age` 18 EQUALS YMD 2022 2 28
-- Monthly anniversaries from 31 January: 28 February, 31 March (src 1391-1392).
#ASSERT `monthly anniversary number` 1 `of a policy effective on` (YMD 2022 1 31) EQUALS YMD 2022 2 28
#ASSERT `monthly anniversary number` 2 `of a policy effective on` (YMD 2022 1 31) EQUALS YMD 2022 3 31
-- A 29 February effective date has its anniversary on 28 February in a common year (fork F3).
#ASSERT `policy anniversary number` 1 `of a policy effective on` (YMD 2024 2 29) EQUALS YMD 2025 2 28
#ASSERT `policy anniversary number` 4 `of a policy effective on` (YMD 2024 2 29) EQUALS YMD 2028 2 29
#ASSERT `the contract year in which` (YMD 2022 3 15) `falls, for a policy effective on` (YMD 2022 3 15) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the contract year in which` (YMD 2023 3 14) `falls, for a policy effective on` (YMD 2022 3 15) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the contract year in which` (YMD 2023 3 15) `falls, for a policy effective on` (YMD 2022 3 15) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the last day of contract year` 5 `of a policy effective on` (YMD 2022 3 15) EQUALS YMD 2027 3 14
#ASSERT `the first monthly anniversary after` (YMD 2024 5 10) `, for a policy effective on` (YMD 2022 3 15) EQUALS YMD 2024 5 15
#ASSERT `the first monthly anniversary after` (YMD 2024 5 15) `, for a policy effective on` (YMD 2022 3 15) EQUALS YMD 2024 6 15
#ASSERT `the first monthly anniversary after` (YMD 2024 5 20) `, for a policy effective on` (YMD 2022 3 15) EQUALS YMD 2024 6 15
-- The age-85 cut-off (Articles 3, Annex 5(4)): born 1950-06-10, effective 2022-03-15; the 85th
-- birthday is 2035-06-10 and the next anniversary 2036-03-15 (fork F6).
#ASSERT `on` (YMD 2036 3 14) `the insured has not passed the policy anniversary after reaching age` 85 `under` (`a policy effective on 15 March 2022 for` (`an insured born on` (YMD 1950 6 10)))
#ASSERT NOT `on` (YMD 2036 3 15) `the insured has not passed the policy anniversary after reaching age` 85 `under` (`a policy effective on 15 March 2022 for` (`an insured born on` (YMD 1950 6 10)))
-- A birthday on the anniversary itself: born 1951-03-15, 85th birthday 2036-03-15, cover runs to the day before 2037-03-15.
#ASSERT `on` (YMD 2037 3 14) `the insured has not passed the policy anniversary after reaching age` 85 `under` (`a policy effective on 15 March 2022 for` (`an insured born on` (YMD 1951 3 15)))

§§ `Annex 1 — who may be insured and who may own the policy (src 1305-1312)`

-- 30 days old on the effective date qualifies, 29 does not; 65 qualifies, 66 does not.
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the insured person qualifies on the effective date of` (`a policy effective on 15 March 2022 for` (`an insured born on` (YMD 2022 2 13)))
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the insured person qualifies on the effective date of` (`a policy effective on 15 March 2022 for` (`an insured born on` (YMD 2022 2 14)))
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the insured person qualifies on the effective date of` (`a policy effective on 15 March 2022 for` (`an insured born on` (YMD 1956 3 16)))
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the insured person qualifies on the effective date of` (`a policy effective on 15 March 2022 for` (`an insured born on` (YMD 1956 3 15)))
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the policyowner qualifies` (Policyowner WITH `kind` IS `an individual`, `age in completed years` IS 18, `full civil legal capacity` IS TRUE, `lawfully established and operating in Vietnam` IS FALSE, `alive` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the policyowner qualifies` (Policyowner WITH `kind` IS `an individual`, `age in completed years` IS 17, `full civil legal capacity` IS TRUE, `lawfully established and operating in Vietnam` IS FALSE, `alive` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the policyowner qualifies` (Policyowner WITH `kind` IS `an organisation`, `age in completed years` IS 0, `full civil legal capacity` IS FALSE, `lawfully established and operating in Vietnam` IS FALSE, `alive` IS TRUE)

§§ `Annex 1 — Hospital, intensive care unit, Doctor, Accident (src 1553-1683)`

GIVEN `in Vietnam`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `seal`         IS A BOOLEAN
      `convalescent` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Medical facility`
`a facility, in Vietnam` `in Vietnam` `, seal` `seal` `, convalescent` `convalescent` MEANS `Medical facility` WITH
    `established and operating under the law of Vietnam or of the host country`  IS TRUE
    `licensed as a hospital under the rules of Vietnam or of the host country`    IS TRUE
    `in Vietnam`                                                                  IS `in Vietnam`
    `its official seal shows the word for hospital`                               IS `seal`
    `its status is shown in the local language by a word understood as hospital`  IS TRUE
    `established for convalescence, nursing, elderly care, or alcohol or drug rehabilitation, or a similar purpose` IS `convalescent`
    `at provincial level or higher, or equivalent`                                IS TRUE

#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the facility is a Hospital` (`a facility, in Vietnam` TRUE `, seal` TRUE `, convalescent` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the facility is a Hospital` (`a facility, in Vietnam` TRUE `, seal` FALSE `, convalescent` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the facility is a Hospital` (`a facility, in Vietnam` FALSE `, seal` FALSE `, convalescent` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the facility is a Hospital` (`a facility, in Vietnam` TRUE `, seal` TRUE `, convalescent` TRUE)

GIVEN `recovery room` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Intensive care unit`
`an intensive care unit, recovery room:` `recovery room` MEANS `Intensive care unit` WITH
    `the hospital it belongs to`                                       IS `a facility, in Vietnam` TRUE `, seal` TRUE `, convalescent` FALSE
    `established for special care and treatment`                       IS TRUE
    `reserved for critically ill patients needing a Doctor's continuous monitoring` IS TRUE
    `equipped to save patients' lives quickly`                         IS TRUE
    `a post-operative recovery room or an emergency room`              IS `recovery room`

#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the unit is an intensive care unit` (`an intensive care unit, recovery room:` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the unit is an intensive care unit` (`an intensive care unit, recovery room:` TRUE)

#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the person is a Doctor` (Doctor WITH `medically qualified in western medicine` IS TRUE, `licensed or recognised to practise medicine lawfully` IS TRUE, `acting within the scope of the licence where the examination or treatment takes place` IS TRUE, `the insured's spouse, parent, child or sibling` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the person is a Doctor` (Doctor WITH `medically qualified in western medicine` IS FALSE, `licensed or recognised to practise medicine lawfully` IS TRUE, `acting within the scope of the licence where the examination or treatment takes place` IS TRUE, `the insured's spouse, parent, child or sibling` IS FALSE)

GIVEN `days` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN Accident
`an accident whose injury came after` `days` MEANS Accident WITH
    `an objective event or continuous chain of events`                  IS TRUE
    `caused by a sudden external force or object`                       IS TRUE
    `unintended and against the insured's will`                         IS TRUE
    `caused injury or death to the insured`                             IS TRUE
    `the direct and sole cause, unrelated to any other cause`           IS TRUE
    `days from the event to the injury or death`                        IS `days`

#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the event is an Accident` (`an accident whose injury came after` 180)
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the event is an Accident` (`an accident whose injury came after` 181)

§§ `Annex 1 — total and permanent disability (src 1583-1615)`

GIVEN `the part`      IS A `Part of the body`
      `the manner`    IS A `Manner of loss`
      `above`         IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date`      IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Loss of a hand, a foot or an eye`
`a loss of` `the part` `by` `the manner` `, at or above the wrist or ankle:` `above` `, confirmed on` `the date` MEANS
    `Loss of a hand, a foot or an eye` OF `the part`, `the manner`, `above`, `the date`

GIVEN `the losses`       IS A LIST OF `Loss of a hand, a foot or an eye`
      `the rate`         IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the assessed on`  IS A DATE
GIVETH A Disablement
`a disablement on 1 January 2024 with losses` `the losses` `, rate` `the rate` `assessed on` `the assessed on` MEANS Disablement WITH
    `date of the insured event`  IS YMD 2024 1 1
    `the losses`                 IS `the losses`
    `assessed percentage of bodily injury or permanent loss of working capacity` IS `the rate`
    `assessed by a provincial Medical Assessment Council or a lawful medical organisation the Company approves` IS TRUE
    `date of the assessment`     IS `the assessed on`

-- (a)(i) both hands lost at the wrist, confirmed at once.
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the insured is totally and permanently disabled` (`a disablement on 1 January 2024 with losses` (LIST `a loss of` `a hand` `by` `physical loss` `, at or above the wrist or ankle:` TRUE `, confirmed on` (YMD 2024 1 1), `a loss of` `a hand` `by` `physical loss` `, at or above the wrist or ankle:` TRUE `, confirmed on` (YMD 2024 1 2)) `, rate` NOTHING `assessed on` (YMD 2024 1 1))
-- A finger-level loss (below the wrist) does not count: one hand left, not TPD.
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the insured is totally and permanently disabled` (`a disablement on 1 January 2024 with losses` (LIST `a loss of` `a hand` `by` `physical loss` `, at or above the wrist or ankle:` TRUE `, confirmed on` (YMD 2024 1 1), `a loss of` `a hand` `by` `physical loss` `, at or above the wrist or ankle:` FALSE `, confirmed on` (YMD 2024 1 2)) `, rate` NOTHING `assessed on` (YMD 2024 1 1))
-- (a)(vi) one foot and one eye's sight; paralysis or blindness confirmed exactly 6 months on counts, a day sooner does not.
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the insured is totally and permanently disabled` (`a disablement on 1 January 2024 with losses` (LIST `a loss of` `a foot` `by` `physical loss` `, at or above the wrist or ankle:` TRUE `, confirmed on` (YMD 2024 1 1), `a loss of` `an eye` `by` `complete and irrecoverable paralysis or blindness` `, at or above the wrist or ankle:` FALSE `, confirmed on` (YMD 2024 7 1)) `, rate` NOTHING `assessed on` (YMD 2024 1 1))
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the insured is totally and permanently disabled` (`a disablement on 1 January 2024 with losses` (LIST `a loss of` `a foot` `by` `physical loss` `, at or above the wrist or ankle:` TRUE `, confirmed on` (YMD 2024 1 1), `a loss of` `an eye` `by` `complete and irrecoverable paralysis or blindness` `, at or above the wrist or ankle:` FALSE `, confirmed on` (YMD 2024 6 30)) `, rate` NOTHING `assessed on` (YMD 2024 1 1))
-- (b) 81% assessed at 6 months: TPD; 80% is not; 81% assessed a day early is not.
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the insured is totally and permanently disabled` (`a disablement on 1 January 2024 with losses` EMPTY `, rate` (JUST 81) `assessed on` (YMD 2024 7 1))
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the insured is totally and permanently disabled` (`a disablement on 1 January 2024 with losses` EMPTY `, rate` (JUST 80) `assessed on` (YMD 2024 7 1))
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 1 — the insured is totally and permanently disabled` (`a disablement on 1 January 2024 with losses` EMPTY `, rate` (JUST 81) `assessed on` (YMD 2024 6 30))

