§§ `Article 11 — free look (src 387-400)`

GIVEN `the notice date` IS A DATE
      `the costs`       IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `Free-look notice`
`a free-look notice given on` `the notice date` `, medical costs` `the costs` MEANS `Free-look notice` WITH
    `date the contract was received`   IS YMD 2022 4 1
    `date of the notice`               IS `the notice date`
    `premiums paid`                    IS 20000000
    `costs of the medical examination` IS `the costs`

#ASSERT `Article 11 — the free-look notice is in time:` (`a free-look notice given on` (YMD 2022 4 22) `, medical costs` NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 11 — the free-look notice is in time:` (`a free-look notice given on` (YMD 2022 4 23) `, medical costs` NOTHING)
#ASSERT `Article 11 — the free-look refund on` (`a free-look notice given on` (YMD 2022 4 10) `, medical costs` (JUST 1000000)) EQUALS 19000000
#ASSERT `Article 11 — the free-look refund on` (`a free-look notice given on` (YMD 2022 4 10) `, medical costs` NOTHING) EQUALS 20000000
