#TRACE `Article 11 — the free-look right on` (`a free-look notice given on` (YMD 2022 4 10) `, medical costs` NOTHING) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the policyowner` DOES `give notice refusing to continue the contract` AT 10
    PARTY `the Company` DOES `terminate the contract and refund the premiums` 20000000 AT 25

