    `kind of change`       IS `the kind`
    `new sum insured`      IS `the new`
    `minimum sum insured`  IS 100000000
    `date approved`        IS `the date` PLUS 10
    `the basic premium changes because the coefficient limits of Annex 4 are not met` IS `premium changes`

