§§ `Articles 17-21 — term, premiums, grace and lapse (src 531-620)`

-- The 100th birthday is 2080-06-10; the next anniversary is 2081-03-15.
#ASSERT `Article 17 — the end of the contract term of` `the 1980 policy` EQUALS YMD 2081 3 15
