#ASSERT NOT `Article 19(d) — top-up premiums of` 100000001 `are within the cap set by an annualised basic premium in year 1 of` 20000000

GIVEN `the year`      IS A NUMBER
      `the zero day`  IS A MAYBE DATE
      `paid`          IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Unpaid premium`
`a premium due 15 March 2023 in contract year` `the year` `, account zero on` `the zero day` `, paid in grace:` `paid` MEANS `Unpaid premium` WITH
    `contract year`                                 IS `the year`
    `due date`                                      IS YMD 2023 3 15
    `date the contract account value became zero`   IS `the zero day`
    `the amount required was paid in full by the end of the grace period` IS `paid`

