#ASSERT `Article 21(c) — the date from which the contract has lapsed, for` (`a premium due 15 March 2023 in contract year` 2 `, account zero on` NOTHING `, paid in grace:` FALSE) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2023 3 15)

§§ `Article 22 — the monthly account step, worked (src 626-689; Annex 2 src 1693-1774)`

-- On the effective date in 2022: a yearly basic premium of 20 million in premium year 1 is
-- allocated at 15% (3 000 000); a cost of insurance of 500 000 and the 2022 administration
-- charge of 30 000 make a deduction of 530 000; the basic account is 2 470 000. A top-up
-- premium of 10 million is allocated at 100%.
`the first premiums` MEANS LIST (`Premium payment` WITH `kind` IS `basic premium`, `amount` IS 20000000, `premium year` IS 1),
                                (`Premium payment` WITH `kind` IS `top-up premium`, `amount` IS 10000000, `premium year` IS 1)
#ASSERT `Article 22(a)(i), (b)(i) — the accounts on the effective date, from` `the first premiums` `, cost of insurance` 500000 `, in calendar year` 2022 EQUALS `Account after a monthly anniversary` WITH `basic account value` IS 2470000, `top-up account value` IS 10000000, `deduction left unpaid` IS 0

GIVEN `basic before` IS A NUMBER
      `top-up before` IS A NUMBER
      `interest`      IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Month of the account`
`a 2022 month from a basic account of` `basic before` `and a top-up account of` `top-up before` `, interest` `interest` MEANS `Month of the account` WITH
    `basic account value at the previous monthly anniversary`   IS `basic before`
    `top-up account value at the previous monthly anniversary`  IS `top-up before`
    `premiums paid since the previous monthly anniversary`      IS EMPTY
    `interest on the basic account`                             IS `interest`
    `interest on the top-up account`                            IS 0
    `loyalty bonus`                                             IS NOTHING
    `cancer-screening support`                                  IS NOTHING
    `cost of insurance for the month`                           IS 500000
    `calendar year of the deduction`                            IS 2022
    `withdrawals from the basic account since`                  IS NOTHING
    `withdrawals from the top-up account since`                 IS NOTHING

-- The next month: 2 470 000 + 7 000 interest - 530 000 = 1 947 000.
