    `claim form completed fully and accurately as the Company requires` IS TRUE
    `certified extract of the death record`               IS `death extract`
    `certificate of the rate of bodily injury or permanent loss of working capacity` IS `rate certificate`
    `medical evidence from the doctor who examined, diagnosed or treated` IS TRUE
    `evidence of entitlement and identity papers of the person entitled` IS TRUE

