§§ `Part V — temporary cover, disclosure, reinstatement, disputes (src 956-1278)`

GIVEN `death date`  IS A DATE
      `accident`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `suicide`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `total sum`   IS A NUMBER
      `premium`     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Temporary-cover claim`
`a death on` `death date` `, accident:` `accident` `, suicide:` `suicide` `, sum insured applied for` `total sum` `, first premium` `premium` MEANS `Temporary-cover claim` WITH
    `date the application was completed and the first premium paid in full` IS YMD 2022 3 1
    `date the certificate was issued`                     IS JUST (YMD 2022 3 20)
    `date the insurance was declined`                     IS NOTHING
    `date the policyowner asked to cancel the application` IS NOTHING
    `date of death`                                       IS `death date`
    `death caused by an Accident`                         IS `accident`
    `death by suicide`                                    IS `suicide`
    `total sum insured of all applications for the same insured` IS `total sum`
    `total first premium paid on all applications for the same insured` IS `premium`
    `costs of the medical examination`                    IS JUST 2000000

