      `alive`        IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Reinstatement request`
`a reinstatement requested on` `request date` `for a lapse in year` `year` `, overdue paid:` `overdue paid` `, alive:` `alive` MEANS `Reinstatement request` WITH
    `date of the lapse`                       IS YMD 2023 3 15
    `date of the request`                     IS `request date`
    `contract year of the lapse`              IS `year`
    `all overdue basic premiums paid`         IS `overdue paid`
    `one due basic premium paid`              IS TRUE
    `all overdue and due rider premiums paid` IS TRUE
    `evidence of health given and insurability conditions met` IS TRUE
    `the insured alive when the Company approves` IS `alive`

